[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_1000","text":"偶像１"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0010","text":"——怎么说呢，是不是有点难相处？\n斑鸠路加小姐。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_2000","text":"新人偶像。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0020","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_3000","text":"偶像２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0030","text":"懂！刚才跟她打招呼也被无视了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0040","text":"肯定是根本没把我们放在眼里吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_1000","text":"偶像１"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0050","text":"感觉真差劲。\n说实话，连她的舞台都不想看。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_3000","text":"偶像２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0060","text":"毕竟她那种态度嘛——对吧，你不这么觉得吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_2000","text":"新人偶像。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0070","text":"────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0090","text":"路加，你要去哪儿？\n马上就到你的出场了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600800_01_0100","text":"闭嘴……"}]
